# Extra ueventd rules for the NW-A55 Android container.
#
# Appended to the MT8127 rules from the FireOS ramdisk. Sony's own /dev is more
# restrictive than Android's: ion and the MTK display nodes are root-only
# (0600), so SurfaceFlinger, which init starts as "system", cannot open them.
# Android's ueventd.rc normally carries these permissions.

/dev/ion                  0666   root       root
/dev/sw_sync              0666   root       root
/dev/mtk_disp             0660   system     graphics
/dev/mtk_ovl              0660   system     graphics
/dev/mtkfb_vsync          0660   system     graphics
